hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2142","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abdur Rahman bin Samura! Hukumat na maango! Beshak agar tumhey wo maangney par di gai to tum uskey supurd kiye jaaogey. Aur agar tumhey wo baghair maangney diye di gai to us par tumhaari madad ki jaaeygi. Aur jab tum qasam khaao aur uskey siwa behtar dekho to apni qasam ka kaffaara do aur jo behtar hai karo. (Bukhari: 6622)"
"2143","[AI-translation] Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam tum mein se koi apni qasam mein apne ghar walon mein zid karey to wo uskey liye Allah key paas gunaahgaar hai is se ke wo apna kaffaara dey jo Allah ne us par farz kya hai. (Bukhari: 6625)"
"2144","[AI-translation] Hishaam key betey Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they jabke Aap Umar bin Khattab ka haath pakdey huey they. To Umar ne Aap se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak tum mujhey har cheez se zyada mehboob ho magar meri jaan se. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nahi, qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai, yahan tak ke main tumhey tumhaari jaan se zyada mehboob hun. To Umar ne Aap se kaha: Beshak ab, Allah ki qasam, tum mujhey meri jaan se zyada mehboob ho. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ab ae Umar! (Bukhari: 6632)"
"2145","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas pahuncha jabke Aap Kaaba key saaye mein farma rahey they: Wo nuqsaan uthaane waley hain Kaaba key Rab ki qasam! Wo nuqsaan uthaane waley hain Kaaba key Rab ki qasam! Main ne kaha: Mera muamla kya hai, kya mujh mein kuchh dekha jaata hai? Mera muamla kya hai? To main Aap key paas baitha jabke Aap farma rahey they. To main khaamosh na reh saka aur mujhey dhaanp liya jo Allah ne chaaaha. To main ne kaha: Wo kaun hain, merey maan baap tum par qurbaan Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Maal mein zyada walay magar jo aisa aisa aisa kahey. (Bukhari: 6638)"
"2146","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmaanon mein se kisi key teen bachchey nahi martay jinhey aag chhuti hai magar qasam poori honay tak. (Bukhari: 6656)"
"2147","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne meri ummat se usey maaf kar diya jo usey waswasa aata hai. Ya uskey dil uskey sath baat kartey hain. Jab tak wo uskey sath amal na karey ya baat na karey. (Bukhari: 6664)"
"2148","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo nazr maanay ke wo Allah ki itaat karega to use uski itaat karni chaahiye. Aur jo nazr maanay ke wo uski naafarmaani karega to wo uski naafarmaani na karey. (Bukhari: 6696)"
"2149","[AI-translation] Ansaari Saad bin Ubaada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us nazr mein fatwa poochha jo uski maan par thi aur wo uskey poora karney se pehley faut hui. To Aap ne usey fatwa diya ke wo uski taraf se poora karey. (Bukhari: 6698)"
"2150","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba dey rahey they ke Aap aadmi key paas they jo khada tha. To Aap ne uskey baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Abu Israel ne nazr maani hai ke wo khada rahega aur na baithega aur na saaya leyga aur na baat karega aur roza rakkheyga. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke wo baat karey aur saaya ley aur baithay aur apna roza poora karey. (Bukhari: 6704). Qasmon key kaffaaron ki kitaab."
